From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joan Karadimov <joan.karadimov@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 20:48:32 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Quote the dialog menu name for llvm-rc

llvm-rc, which is windres in CLANG64, wants a string or number after
MENU in a dialog. rc.exe and GNU windres accept the quoted form too.

Upstream: not submitted; OpenJDK itself only builds Windows with Visual Studio
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../windows/native/jaccessinspector/jaccessinspectorWindow.rc   | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/jdk.accessibility/windows/native/jaccessinspector/jaccessinspectorWindow.rc b/src/jdk.accessibility/windows/native/jaccessinspector/jaccessinspectorWindow.rc
index fcddea564..9e5c939d8 100644
--- a/src/jdk.accessibility/windows/native/jaccessinspector/jaccessinspectorWindow.rc
+++ b/src/jdk.accessibility/windows/native/jaccessinspector/jaccessinspectorWindow.rc
@@ -44,7 +44,7 @@
 JACCESSINSPECTORWINDOW DIALOG  160, 78, 354, 214
 STYLE DS_SETFONT | WS_MINIMIZEBOX | WS_MAXIMIZEBOX | WS_VISIBLE | WS_CAPTION | WS_SYSMENU | WS_THICKFRAME
 CAPTION "jaccessinspector"
-MENU cjaccessinspectorMenus
+MENU "cjaccessinspectorMenus"
 FONT 8, "MS Sans Serif"
 BEGIN
     EDITTEXT        cjaccessinspectorText,4,24,340,184,ES_MULTILINE | ES_AUTOVSCROLL | ES_READONLY | WS_VSCROLL
